        <figcaption>front view of the headphones
    </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
        <img src="images/product-view-2.jpg" alt="picture of headphones" style="width: 350px;">
        <figcaption>front view of the headphones
    </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
        <img src="images/product-view-3.jpg" alt="picture of headphones" style="width: 56.5%; border: 2px solid black;">
        <figcaption>Hangs on wall hook
    </figcaption>
